<!doctype lake><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="fixed" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><h2 data-lake-id="nuIuw" id="nuIuw"><span data-lake-id="u78c2edb8" id="u78c2edb8">功能描述</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u99512a6c" id="u99512a6c"><span data-lake-id="u9ea09145" id="u9ea09145">WritebackQueue 保存已经离开 Cache Array 的那一份副本，并把它写回到 L2 Cache中。MainPipe 的 s3 一旦把请求交进来，Array 里的旧行就可以被覆盖。后面 L2 还没收完，也不用再回 Array 里读。</span></p><p data-lake-id="ua3ae8591" id="ua3ae8591"><span data-lake-id="u8963f9f4" id="u8963f9f4">它收四类东西：</span></p><ul list="u61020c95"><li fid="u298a92e1" data-lake-id="ud41a2076" id="ud41a2076"><span data-lake-id="uc93bb98f" id="uc93bb98f">refill 换出的有效旧行。SC、UC 是干净的 Evict。UD 是 WriteBackFull，必须带 64B。</span></li><li fid="u298a92e1" data-lake-id="u830fd294" id="u830fd294"><span data-lake-id="ud1b6d90f" id="ud1b6d90f">Snoop 的应答。无数据走 TXRSP，有数据走 TXDAT。</span></li><li fid="u298a92e1" data-lake-id="u54687f60" id="u54687f60"><span data-lake-id="u8d344e96" id="u8d344e96">CMO clean、flush 要写回的脏行。</span></li><li fid="u298a92e1" data-lake-id="uf1379338" id="uf1379338"><span data-lake-id="ua76d597d" id="ua76d597d">refill 返回“共享且 PassDirty”时先交下来的脏数据。本地最后安装成 SC，不在 L1 留 SD。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue5eb10e7" id="ue5eb10e7"><span data-lake-id="u28206b22" id="u28206b22">队列有 18 项，必须比 16 个 MSHR 多。原因是 MissQueue 不保存写回数据。最坏时 16 个 MSHR 各自已经交出一条写回，而这些写回还在等 L2。这时下一次 refill 的 s3 仍要能再放进一条，否则新的安装会被写回堵住。18 项留出这个余量。同地址的旧项还在时，新的同地址请求仍然不收，余量不能拿来违反同地址唯一。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u1c282b52" id="u1c282b52"><span data-lake-id="u509df6a8" id="u509df6a8">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="u85900fb7" id="u85900fb7"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F35409901%2F1793276659979-0d52bd6c-e591-46ca-90bb-22184a17ed4f.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ubddb9cd8-5a28-403c-86e6-09dc90e7eac%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22uf515d7bf-165a-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A726.5454545454545%2C%22height%22%3A285%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22WriteBackQueue%E6%9E%B6%E6%9E%84%E5%9B%BE.drawio.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A84468%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A999%2C%22originHeight%22%3A392%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22WRITEBACKQUEUE%22%2C%22x%22%3A606%2C%22y%22%3A206%2C%22width%22%3A151%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MISSCONFLICTCHECK%22%2C%22x%22%3A392%2C%22y%22%3A186%2C%22width%22%3A171%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SNOOPREG%22%2C%22x%22%3A767%2C%22y%22%3A76%2C%22width%22%3A102%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MAINPIPE%22%2C%22x%22%3A54%2C%22y%22%3A160%2C%22width%22%3A87%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BLOCKMISS%22%2C%22x%22%3A209%2C%22y%22%3A186%2C%22width%22%3A94%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LOADPIPE%22%2C%22x%22%3A48%2C%22y%22%3A91%2C%22width%22%3A95%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MISSREG%22%2C%22x%22%3A374%2C%22y%22%3A75%2C%22width%22%3A76%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MISSQUEUE%22%2C%22x%22%3A467%2C%22y%22%3A91%2C%22width%22%3A106%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SPRXRSP%22%2C%22x%22%3A736%2C%22y%22%3A264%2C%22width%22%3A114%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PROBEQUEUE%22%2C%22x%22%3A879%2C%22y%22%3A91%2C%22width%22%3A114%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LOADPIPE%22%2C%22x%22%3A55%2C%22y%22%3A22%2C%22width%22%3A83%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MAINPIPE%22%2C%22x%22%3A652%2C%22y%22%3A91%2C%22width%22%3A93%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22XEVT%22%2C%22x%22%3A518%2C%22y%22%3A261%2C%22width%22%3A62%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MISSARB%22%2C%22x%22%3A268%2C%22y%22%3A92%2C%22width%22%3A77%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222CACHE%22%2C%22x%22%3A640%2C%22y%22%3A336%2C%22width%22%3A80%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22REFILL%22%2C%22x%22%3A583%2C%22y%22%3A75%2C%22width%22%3A45%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WBREG%22%2C%22x%22%3A707%2C%22y%22%3A147%2C%22width%22%3A61%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TXDAT%22%2C%22x%22%3A623%2C%22y%22%3A264%2C%22width%22%3A69%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MISS%22%2C%22x%22%3A195%2C%22y%22%3A77%2C%22width%22%3A48%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f8f6f6%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u65f2fcb0%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u0c9e85be" id="u0c9e85be"><span data-lake-id="u7a4300cc" id="u7a4300cc">​</span><br></p><h2 data-lake-id="xtyhO" id="xtyhO"><span data-lake-id="uf4700d31" id="uf4700d31">参数描述</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u6f88aa1e" id="u6f88aa1e"><span data-lake-id="u1641aadb" id="u1641aadb">组织参数以总览为准。</span></p><table data-lake-id="zLeyo" id="zLeyo" margin="true" class="lake-table" style="width: 688px"><colgroup><col width="164"><col width="152"><col width="372"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id="ub2e26b09" id="ub2e26b09"><td data-lake-id="u37e1fabd" id="u37e1fabd"><p data-lake-id="u5ace0825" id="u5ace0825"><span data-lake-id="uc11b4ac1" id="uc11b4ac1">参数</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uf58bce04" id="uf58bce04"><p data-lake-id="u511ad205" id="u511ad205"><span data-lake-id="uda44c1ad" id="uda44c1ad">值</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u7067ed7a" id="u7067ed7a"><p data-lake-id="u47755e9c" id="u47755e9c"><span data-lake-id="u010cf5a2" id="u010cf5a2">WritebackQueue 里怎么用</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u6186e461" id="u6186e461"><td data-lake-id="u428836ec" id="u428836ec"><p data-lake-id="u48cc2dae" id="u48cc2dae"><span data-lake-id="u8cde02c7" id="u8cde02c7">nReleaseEntries</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u72406eb5" id="u72406eb5"><p data-lake-id="uc1992819" id="uc1992819"><span data-lake-id="ubedf945d" id="ubedf945d">18</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u7b9531a5" id="u7b9531a5"><p data-lake-id="u508e8a39" id="u508e8a39"><span data-lake-id="uf2e84e18" id="uf2e84e18">项号 0～17。必须大于 nMissEntries</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u49ca2c7e" id="u49ca2c7e"><td data-lake-id="u45a77e1a" id="u45a77e1a"><p data-lake-id="u8e51888b" id="u8e51888b"><span data-lake-id="uaa63555d" id="uaa63555d">evtTxnId</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u08fb0d45" id="u08fb0d45"><p data-lake-id="uc8325e8f" id="uc8325e8f"><span data-lake-id="u2e06265d" id="u2e06265d">17～34</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u4a7d016d" id="u4a7d016d"><p data-lake-id="ueb71faaa" id="ueb71faaa"><span data-lake-id="ufd8b9a10" id="ufd8b9a10">主动写回的 TXEVT.txnId = 17 + 项号。禁止使用 0～16，那些属于 MSHR 和 CMO</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="ubfab6004" id="ubfab6004"><td data-lake-id="uc33ea27f" id="uc33ea27f"><p data-lake-id="u9e49879b" id="u9e49879b"><span data-lake-id="ucbe2c404" id="ucbe2c404">snpTxnId</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ufbbc8166" id="ufbbc8166"><p data-lake-id="u3abe7572" id="u3abe7572"><span data-lake-id="ucf70fc24" id="ucf70fc24">8 bit</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u06661d41" id="u06661d41"><p data-lake-id="u8d79b0e8" id="u8d79b0e8"><span data-lake-id="u02b7b804" id="u02b7b804">只有 Snoop 应答使用。原样带回 RXSNP.txnId，不用上面的 17～34</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="ub78716ef" id="ub78716ef"><td data-lake-id="u7534fc26" id="u7534fc26"><p data-lake-id="u29ba98b8" id="u29ba98b8"><span data-lake-id="u5f0bc234" id="u5f0bc234">blockBytes</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u2c194ddb" id="u2c194ddb"><p data-lake-id="u71f028db" id="u71f028db"><span data-lake-id="u95633ada" id="u95633ada">64</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="udade5eeb" id="udade5eeb"><p data-lake-id="u5d5db5d3" id="u5d5db5d3"><span data-lake-id="ue5244058" id="ue5244058">有数据的项保存整行。TXDAT 每拍 32B，</span><code data-lake-id="u9d55ca53" id="u9d55ca53"><span data-lake-id="u1c0567f0" id="u1c0567f0">dataId=0</span></code><span data-lake-id="u48d17810" id="u48d17810"> 是低半行，</span><code data-lake-id="u357e3a46" id="u357e3a46"><span data-lake-id="u9bc0a8aa" id="u9bc0a8aa">dataId=1</span></code><span data-lake-id="u4da3e534" id="u4da3e534"> 是高半行</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u5250951a" id="u5250951a"><td data-lake-id="uc76afdb1" id="uc76afdb1"><p data-lake-id="u61279a68" id="u61279a68"><span data-lake-id="ubac0fd6d" id="ubac0fd6d">数据宽度</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="udfc80ea4" id="udfc80ea4"><p data-lake-id="u14111d4b" id="u14111d4b"><span data-lake-id="u8cdbba2b" id="u8cdbba2b">256 bit</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uecad2cec" id="uecad2cec"><p data-lake-id="ue9d90a1e" id="ue9d90a1e"><span data-lake-id="udf1c2f4d" id="udf1c2f4d">两拍发完。两拍中间可以有气泡，不能插入另一项的数据</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u03d49fb7" id="u03d49fb7"><td data-lake-id="u0fa63fb3" id="u0fa63fb3"><p data-lake-id="udb4d3a5a" id="udb4d3a5a"><span data-lake-id="ud7c4ea53" id="ud7c4ea53">Meta</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ue5a14630" id="ue5a14630"><p data-lake-id="u31c73626" id="u31c73626"><span data-lake-id="ube7746ac" id="ube7746ac">I、SC、UC、UD</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u22463906" id="u22463906"><p data-lake-id="u3dd79e45" id="u3dd79e45"><span data-lake-id="udedfa3e7" id="udedfa3e7">队列不保存 SD。UD 进入时一定 </span><code data-lake-id="udac15bd7" id="udac15bd7"><span data-lake-id="u93e1da8c" id="u93e1da8c">hasData=1</span></code></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-lake-id="u1a779266" id="u1a779266"><br></p><h2 data-lake-id="CRPjP" id="CRPjP"><span data-lake-id="uaa30b4ee" id="uaa30b4ee">接口描述</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u4b7dc1ea" id="u4b7dc1ea"><span data-lake-id="u15a5c791" id="u15a5c791">方向按照从WriteBackQueue的视角来看。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u217904e3" id="u217904e3"><span data-lake-id="ue45f8265" id="ue45f8265">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="u5cee9554" id="u5cee9554"><strong><span data-lake-id="u06e2e582" id="u06e2e582">WBQIOBundle</span></strong></p><table data-lake-id="urnv5" id="urnv5" margin="true" class="lake-table" st